{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It's an action game in which the jellyfish in the aquarium comfort her as she sorrows and eases her heart.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The player must help the jellyfish in the tank and heal her.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >May the time we spend together be irreplaceable.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Carefully designed graphics and gentle sound.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >New voice cast added!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Easy to use with just a mouse.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy this miniature antique story!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3821190/extras/accf2103b2ad99537ea882c6bcfc6043.avif?t=1755021632\" width=480 height=360 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u25bcHow to play</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I gaze calmly into the aquarium.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can cheer up the jellyfish in the tank by clicking on it with your mouse.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Even if the words don't reach you, your feelings will.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u25bcWorld view</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A story of a sad girl and her kind jellyfish.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Even if I raise my voice, it won't be heard</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I can't reach it even if I reach out</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I knew the answer</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I am just a jellyfish.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But I still want to make her smile.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I'll convey the words to you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You write the words addressed to me.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If it were possible, I'd be happy if you called me by my name.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >So that my heart(voice) can reach you...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3821190/extras/baf0aed4de3f3120f18e7cbe51c227fb.avif?t=1755021632\" width=480 height=360 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>It's surely a modest dream-like scene.</i></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3821190?t=1755021632","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3821190/cf00da12b89d462d0d7bdc62350538a855afef64/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1755021632","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3821190/0e223cdc5a6dc2206194bf7e35f4dd5a90046b84/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1755021632","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3821190/0e223cdc5a6dc2206194bf7e35f4dd5a90046b84/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1755021632","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It's an action game in which the jellyfish in the aquarium comfort her as she sorrows and eases her heart.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The player must help the jellyfish in the tank and heal her.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb